f this morning at 10 a.m. PT at Apple Park, starting a week full of expected announcements around Siri, iOS 27, Apple Intelligence and more, along with developer event...",source:"TechCrunch",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"Jun 9, 2026, 2:04 PM EDT",ago:"5 days ago"},{url:"https://venturebeat.com/technology/on-device-ai-agents-hit-a-hard-memory-limit-apples-new-architecture-routes-around-it",img:"https://cdn.snapi.dev/images/v1/i/s/x/apl38-3544827-3745038.jpg",title:"On-device AI agents hit a hard memory limit. Apple's new architecture routes around it.",text:"On-device AI models have stayed small because the entire weight set has to live in DRAM, capping practical parameter counts well below what server-side deployments use. Enterprise architects evaluatin...",source:"VentureBeat",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"Jun 9, 2026, 1:49 PM EDT",ago:"5 days ago"},{url:"https://techxplore.com/news/2026-06-eu-apple-blame-delayed-siri.html",img:"https://cdn.snapi.dev/images/v1/b/a/p/apl48-3541354-3744883.jpg",title:"EU rejects Apple blame for delayed Siri AI rollout",text:"The EU on Tuesday rejected Apple's blame for the delayed rollout of its AI-enhanced voice assistant, saying it was up to the U.S. giant to make products that follow the rules.",source:"TechXplore",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"Jun 9, 2026, 1:20 PM EDT",ago:"5 days ago"},{url:"https://invezz.com/news/2026/06/09/apple-stock-falls-4-after-ai-reveal-despite-analyst-optimism-on-siri/",img:"https://cdn.snapi.dev/images/v1/m/0/m/apl44-3542212-3744838.jpg",title:"Apple stock falls 4% after AI reveal despite analyst optimism on Siri",text:"Apple AAPL shares fell 4.4% on Tuesday, a day after the company unveiled a series of artificial intelligence initiatives at its annual Worldwide Developers Conference (WWDC). The decline put the stock...",source:"Invezz",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"Jun 9, 2026, 1:07 PM EDT",ago:"5 days ago"},{url:"2leQAAVY8nM",img:"https://cdn.snapi.dev/images/v1/8/g/p/comput